fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"qroverlay/GstBaseQROverlay.html#GstBaseQROverlay:case-sensitive","fragment":"\n\tcase-sensitive\n\nStrings to encode are case sensitive (e.g. passwords or SSIDs).\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.22\n\t\t\n"});